Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 500, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 524, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 623, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 631, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 632, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}]

--------------------------------------------------
Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.Koder
Column name: Kod Type: STRING Description: this field contains the 'code' which can be something like '5230' or '02' or 'O' -- there are 470 unique codes
Column name: KodTyp Type: STRING Description: this field indicates the type of the code -- there are 7 types: 'MORPH' (morphology), 'GEO' (geography), 'TOP' (topography), 'HER' (heredity), 'TISSUE', 'TREAT' (treatment), and 'RACE'
Column name: Aktiv Type: STRING Description: whether or not this code is active -- almost always 'J' (yes), but is 'N' once and blank once
Column name: Intern Type: STRING Description: whether or not this code is internal -- almost always 'J' (yes), but is 'N' once and blank once
Column name: Benamning Type: STRING Description: the 'long' name corresponding to this code, eg 'Vascular and perivascular tumors (all subtypes)'
Column name: Kortnamn Type: STRING Description: the 'short' name corresponding to this code, eg 'Adipo'
Column name: Notering Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
Column name: Inregdatum Type: STRING Description: this field contains a date, eg 'Jul 7 2000 12:00AM' or 'Jan 9 2014 12:00AM'
Column name: GiltigFran Type: STRING Description: this field appears to contain the same date
Column name: GiltigTill Type: STRING Description: this field contains a date far into the future, eg 'Dec 27 2063 12:00AM'
Column name: Flagga1 Type: STRING Description: unknown field -- either blank (443 rows) or '1' (41 rows)
Column name: Flagga2 Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
Column name: Flagga3 Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
Column name: Flagga4 Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank
Sample rows:
[{'Kod': ' ', 'KodTyp': 'GEO', 'Aktiv': ' ', 'Intern': ' ', 'Benamning': ' ', 'Kortnamn': None, 'Notering': None, 'Inregdatum': None, 'GiltigFran': None, 'GiltigTill': None, 'Flagga1': None, 'Flagga2': None, 'Flagga3': None, 'Flagga4': None}, {'Kod': '1000', 'KodTyp': 'GEO', 'Aktiv': 'J', 'Intern': 'N', 'Benamning': 'Africa unspec', 'Kortnamn': 'Afr', 'Notering': None, 'Inregdatum': None, 'GiltigFran': None, 'GiltigTill': None, 'Flagga1': None, 'Flagga2': None, 'Flagga3': None, 'Flagga4': None}, {'Kod': '1075', 'KodTyp': 'GEO', 'Aktiv': 'J', 'Intern': 'N', 'Benamning': 'Tunisia', 'Kortnamn': 'TN', 'Notering': None, 'Inregdatum': None, 'GiltigFran': None, 'GiltigTill': None, 'Flagga1': None, 'Flagga2': None, 'Flagga3': None, 'Flagga4': None}, {'Kod': '2000', 'KodTyp': 'GEO', 'Aktiv': 'J', 'Intern': 'N', 'Benamning': 'Latin America unspec', 'Kortnamn': 'Lat Am', 'Notering': None, 'Inregdatum': None, 'GiltigFran': None, 'GiltigTill': None, 'Flagga1': None, 'Flagga2': None, 'Flagga3': None, 'Flagga4': None}, {'Kod': '2043', 'KodTyp': 'GEO', 'Aktiv': 'J', 'Intern': 'N', 'Benamning': 'Dominican Republic', 'Kortnamn': 'DO', 'Notering': None, 'Inregdatum': None, 'GiltigFran': None, 'GiltigTill': None, 'Flagga1': None, 'Flagga2': None, 'Flagga3': None, 'Flagga4': None}]

