Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.MolClinGene
Column name: MolClin Type: STRING Description: flag indicating either molecular 'M', or clinical 'C'
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number, eg '15563'
Column name: InvNo Type: INT64 Description: investigation number, usually between 1 and 10
Column name: OrderNo Type: INT64 Description: order number, between 1 and 15
Column name: Prefix Type: STRING Description: prefix string -- either blank or '+' 
Column name: Gene Type: STRING Description: gene symbol(s), eg 'KMT2A' or 'BCR/ABL1'
Column name: Suffix Type: STRING Description: suffix string -- either blank or '+'
Sample rows:
[{'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 3967, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Prefix': None, 'Gene': 'BCR::ABL1', 'Suffix': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 3976, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Prefix': None, 'Gene': 'BCR::ABL1', 'Suffix': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 3976, 'InvNo': 2, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Prefix': None, 'Gene': 'BCR::ABL1', 'Suffix': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 4541, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Prefix': None, 'Gene': 'PML::RARA', 'Suffix': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 4624, 'InvNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Prefix': None, 'Gene': 'BCR::ABL1', 'Suffix': None}]

